{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a764b80e-8748-8530-b927-0d4f360da4c6",
  "created_at": "2026-02-02T12:07:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Terrence Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:00:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:00:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. Yes, my name is Terrence Reardon. I am calling about a streetlight, I think. It is not working."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:00:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure, I can help with that. Where is the light?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:01:01-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 236 Kay Street. In front of the house, more or less, on the pole by the corner. Sorry, I am on the speaker, my hands are, um, full with papers. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:01:21-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine. 236 Kay Street, on the Hill. Is the whole light out, or does it flicker on and off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:01:33-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is completely out. Dark. Nothing. And the problem is there is a crosswalk right there, so at night you cannot see anybody crossing. I do not feel safe. Last week I almost, um, [pause] I almost walked into a person with a stroller because I did not see her until she was very close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:02:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not good, a dark crosswalk. How long has it been out, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:02:11-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think about ten days. Maybe a little more. I noticed it after the holidays, when I came home from work, and it was already dark there. Every night since then, the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:02:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And is it the pole right at the crosswalk, or the next one down the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:02:39-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The pole right at the crosswalk. The next one down is working, but it is far, and it does not reach. So the street is lit, but the crosswalk is in the shadow, you understand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:02:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. Do you see a number or a tag on the pole, like a little metal plate or a sticker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:03:10-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, I have to go look, I will take the phone... [line breaks up] ...no, I am sorry, I am not going outside now, it is cold. From the window I cannot read. I can go after lunch, if you need it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:03:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, don't bother. The address and the crosswalk are enough for us to find it. I'll put in a work order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:03:45-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Could you ask for a crew to check the pole? Maybe it is only the bulb, but maybe it is the electricity, I do not know. I would like somebody to look at it, to be sure it is okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:04:07-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll write it up so they check the pole and the fixture both. If it turns out to be the power feed, sometimes that goes to the utility, but the crew will sort out who does what."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:04:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that is fine. I do not care who, only that the light comes back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:04:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Can I get a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:04:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0190."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:04:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-oh. Got it. And it's Reardon, R-E-A-R-D-O-N?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Terrence with two R, and then one N, no, sorry, Terrence is T-E-R-R-E-N-C-E. Reardon like you said."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I've got it all down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:05:08-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. You know, it is a small thing, but I am a little embarrassed to call, because I made a plan for the New Year, to finally clean out the closet, and I have been so busy with that, I did not call before. Ten days, I should have called on the first day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:05:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine. Calling now is what counts. A lot of people wait to see if somebody else reports it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:05:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, maybe somebody did. But I prefer to be sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:05:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally fair. Let me check, hang on one second while I look at the list for that area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:06:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:06:07-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. I don't see an open ticket for that pole, so you're the first one on it. I've got it logged now with the crosswalk noted as the priority."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:06:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And about the time, do you know when they come? Today, this week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:06:32-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Streetlight repairs usually get done within a week or two, depending on the parts and the weather. A crosswalk gets bumped up a bit, so I'd say sooner rather than later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:06:49-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A week or two, I can wait for that. In the meantime I will carry the flashlight when I walk, and tell my neighbors to be careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:07:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good idea. And if it's still dark after two weeks, call back and mention the work order and we'll chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:07:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will do that. Do I need a number for the order?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:07:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll give you one. Just say it's the Kay Street crosswalk light from today, Monday, and whoever picks up can find it by your address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, Kay Street crosswalk light, today. Okay. Thank you, Denise, you were very helpful."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy to help, Mr. Reardon. Take care, and enjoy the rest of your lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T12:07:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
